### Create mood without timestamp
POST http://localhost:8080/api/moods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 7,
  "note": "Felt focused"
}

### Create mood with custom (past) timestamp
POST http://localhost:8080/api/moods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 5,
  "note": "Backfilled entry",
  "ts": "2025-08-30T18:00:00Z"
}

### Create mood with future timestamp (should fail 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/moods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 3,
  "note": "Future mood?",
  "ts": "2999-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### List moods (newest first)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/moods
Accept: application/json
